      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.29,
          "end": 4.48,
          "en": "So what is routing about?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.48,
          "end": 7.9,
          "en": "Attached you find another starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.9,
          "end": 11.22,
          "en": "which when you start the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.22,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "gives you this simple application on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 16.08,
          "en": "This is a view app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 18.57,
          "en": "where we have two main areas,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.57,
          "end": 20.46,
          "en": "Teams and Users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.46,
          "end": 21.75,
          "en": "we can switch between them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.75,
          "end": 22.61,
          "en": "and for every team,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.61,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "we can also click View Members,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 25.93,
          "en": "though at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.93,
          "end": 28.09,
          "en": "nothing happens when we do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.09,
          "end": 30.98,
          "en": "So that's a very simple starting application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.98,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "and if we have a look at this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 37.94,
          "en": "it looks like if we had two pages here, right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.94,
          "end": 40.36,
          "en": "two links here in the navigation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.36,
          "end": 43.12,
          "en": "the teams and the users link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.12,
          "end": 45.27,
          "en": "But what you will notice is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.27,
          "end": 47.78,
          "en": "that when I click those links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.78,
          "end": 50.7,
          "en": "what we see on the screen changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.7,
          "end": 53.61,
          "en": "but the URL does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.61,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "It's always the same URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 57.05,
          "en": "And that's in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.05,
          "end": 58.99,
          "en": "what routing will be about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 58.99,
          "end": 60.96,
          "en": "With View we build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 60.96,
          "end": 65.24,
          "en": "JavaScript driven client side web applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.24,
          "end": 67.08,
          "en": "So web applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.08,
          "end": 69.43,
          "en": "where what the user sees,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 69.43,
          "end": 71.28999999999999,
          "en": "is entirely controlled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 71.28999999999999,
          "end": 74.28999999999999,
          "en": "by JavaScript running in the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 74.28999999999999,
          "end": 76.253,
          "en": "That is what a View is all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.1,
          "end": 79.01,
          "en": "And we're also basically building a",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 79.01,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "so called single page application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 83.09,
          "en": "which means we have that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.09,
          "end": 85.37,
          "en": "one single HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 85.37,
          "end": 86.72,
          "en": "which is being fetched,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 86.72,
          "end": 89.56,
          "en": "and that file includes imports to the,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.56,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "to the scripts to all the JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 94.77000000000001,
          "en": "we're writing here in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 94.77000000000001,
          "end": 97.07,
          "en": "not to the code we are writing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 97.07,
          "end": 99.00999999999999,
          "en": "but to a slightly transformed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 99.00999999999999,
          "end": 100.8,
          "en": "and optimized version of that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 100.8,
          "end": 103.24000000000001,
          "en": "And the CLI is taking care of all of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 103.24000000000001,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 107.47,
          "en": "But in the end it's all that JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 107.47,
          "end": 108.93,
          "en": "which runs in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 108.93,
          "end": 111.1,
          "en": "which is responsible for what we see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 111.1,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "on the screen here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 114.25,
          "en": "And that's why we call this kind of app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 114.25,
          "end": 116.053,
          "en": "a single page application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 117.19,
          "end": 118.53999999999999,
          "en": "So we want to have just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 118.53999999999999,
          "end": 120.42,
          "en": "one HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 120.42,
          "end": 123.65,
          "en": "and then our JavaScript code controlling what we see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 123.65,
          "end": 125.09,
          "en": "on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 125.09,
          "end": 126.62,
          "en": "But with this approach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 126.62,
          "end": 128.34,
          "en": "we have one problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 128.34,
          "end": 131.27,
          "en": "we have the same URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 131.27,
          "end": 132.94,
          "en": "for all areas",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 132.94,
          "end": 134.29,
          "en": "of our page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 134.29,
          "end": 137.48,
          "en": "And that means if I would want to share",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 137.48,
          "end": 138.97,
          "en": "this user's page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 138.97,
          "end": 141.24,
          "en": "with another user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 141.24,
          "end": 144.63,
          "en": "well I could just share this regular URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 144.63,
          "end": 146.68,
          "en": "which in this case is just our domain name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 146.68,
          "end": 147.86,
          "en": "and then nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 147.86,
          "end": 148.89,
          "en": "And if you enter this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 148.89,
          "end": 150.03,
          "en": "and hit Enter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 150.03,
          "end": 152.43,
          "en": "you always end up on the starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 152.43,
          "end": 154.97,
          "en": "So I can't share anything else",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 154.97,
          "end": 158.15,
          "en": "than the starting page off this application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 158.15,
          "end": 161.32999999999998,
          "en": "Because the change that happens when I click this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 161.32999999999998,
          "end": 163.52,
          "en": "is driven by JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 163.52,
          "end": 166.36,
          "en": "and has nothing to do with the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 166.36,
          "end": 168.97,
          "en": "It just happens up on the button, click here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 168.97,
          "end": 170.867,
          "en": "And whilst this works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 170.867,
          "end": 172.87,
          "en": "and this application works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 172.87,
          "end": 176.74,
          "en": "in reality, you would want applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 176.74,
          "end": 178.23,
          "en": "powered by you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 178.23,
          "end": 181.7,
          "en": "and powered by that client's JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 181.7,
          "end": 184.82,
          "en": "which still interact with the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 184.82,
          "end": 187.57,
          "en": "so that the URL represents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 187.57,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "where on the page we are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 189.78,
          "end": 193.33,
          "en": "and so did we got a shareable URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 193.33,
          "end": 196.07,
          "en": "which we can share with our users,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 196.07,
          "end": 197.57,
          "en": "so that I could share",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 197.57,
          "end": 199.2,
          "en": "a link to this Users page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 199.2,
          "end": 200.52,
          "en": "with our users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 200.52,
          "end": 202.053,
          "en": "of this web application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 204.36,
          "end": 206.19,
          "en": "And of course we could try to make this work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 206.19,
          "end": 208.87,
          "en": "by having more than one HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 208.87,
          "end": 212.29,
          "en": "and then pointing at a different HTML file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 212.29,
          "end": 214.51,
          "en": "like users HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 214.51,
          "end": 216.64,
          "en": "But that's not how this will work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 216.64,
          "end": 219.82,
          "en": "This is not how you build such view applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 219.82,
          "end": 221.46,
          "en": "If you would do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 222.74,
          "en": "the script code loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 222.74,
          "end": 224.98,
          "en": "by that extra HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 224.98,
          "end": 226.74,
          "en": "would be totally unrelated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 226.74,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "to your other script code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 231.65,
          "en": "which is probably also not what you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 231.65,
          "end": 234.09,
          "en": "And that's the kind of problem routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 234.09,
          "end": 235.64,
          "en": "will solve for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 235.64,
          "end": 236.93,
          "en": "Because it turns out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 236.93,
          "end": 239,
          "en": "that there is a tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 239,
          "end": 240.16,
          "en": "an extra package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 240.16,
          "end": 241.6,
          "en": "which we can install,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 241.6,
          "end": 245.01,
          "en": "which allows us to handle URL changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 245.01,
          "end": 247.53,
          "en": "with JavaScript in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 247.53,
          "end": 250.05,
          "en": "and then load something different on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 250.05,
          "end": 252.59,
          "en": "in the same single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 252.59,
          "end": 254.62,
          "en": "when that URL changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 254.62,
          "end": 256.93,
          "en": "or based on that URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 256.93,
          "end": 258.45,
          "en": "And that same package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 258.45,
          "end": 261.33,
          "en": "will also help us change the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 261.33,
          "end": 264.41,
          "en": "when we navigate somewhere else in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 264.41,
          "end": 267.11,
          "en": "so that the URL reflects the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 267.11,
          "end": 268.21,
          "en": "where we are",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 268.21,
          "end": 269.2,
          "en": "in the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 269.2,
          "end": 271.56,
          "en": "And that is what routing is all about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 271.56,
          "end": 273.27,
          "en": "and why we might want it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 273.27,
          "end": 275.65999999999997,
          "en": "So let's now install that extra package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 275.65999999999997,
          "end": 277.543,
          "en": "to get started with routing.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
